## Interface: 16001
## Title: PvP Watchlist
## Notes: Marks whoever attacks you first in world PvP, warns you when they show up again and shares the list with friends and guild. /pvpw
## Notes-ptBR: Marca quem te ataca primeiro no PvP de mundo, avisa quando ele aparece de novo e troca a lista com amigos e guilda. /pvpw
